        "**Finding:** Every customer with a missing `avg_order_value_kes` has a positive purchase\n",
        "frequency and positive lifetime spend, they clearly did place orders with some average value,\n",
        "it just was not recorded. None of the missingness lines up with `frequency_per_year == 0`, which\n",
