        "With no missing values remaining, `StandardScaler` is fit on the imputed feature matrix. `fit()`\n",
        "learns each feature's mean and standard deviation from this data, and `transform()` applies\n",
        "`(x - mean) / std` to every value. Only `.fit_transform()` is called once, on the full training\n",
        "set that will be used to choose k and fit the final K-Means model this fitted `scaler` (with its\n",
        "learned means and standard deviations) is exactly what must be reused, unrefit, on any new\n",
        "customer, so that a new customer is placed on the same scale the clusters were formed\n",
        "on."
      ]
